---
import MBPRLayout from "../layouts/MBPRLayout.astro";
---
<MBPRLayout title="Foster | Mission Bay Puppy Rescue" description="Learn what it takes to foster a puppy with Mission Bay Puppy Rescue in San Diego.">
<section class="page-intro">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">Join The MBPR Family</span>
    <h1>Foster A Pup</h1>
    <p class="lede">Fostering is how we say yes when a shelter calls with pups running out of time.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section tight">
  <div class="container split">
    <div class="content-flow">
      <h2>Why Fostering Matters</h2>
      <p class="lede">[DRAFT &mdash; why fostering lets MBPR say yes, final wording pending]<span class="draft-flag">Content Needed</span></p>
      <p style="opacity:.8;">Every foster home is a life saved. Without fosters, we simply can&rsquo;t pull another pup from an overcrowded shelter.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-gold" href="#foster-application">Apply to Foster</a>
    </div>
    <div class="media">
      <img src="https://missionbaypuppyrescue.org/cdn/shop/files/happy-beagle-mix-dog-wide-smile-floppy-ears_1024x1024.webp?v=1738512278" alt="A foster puppy at Mission Bay Puppy Rescue">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section sand-deep">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">What Makes A Good MBPR Foster</span>
    <h2 style="margin-bottom:30px;">What To Expect</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      <div class="action-block">
        <div class="icon-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 11.5L12 4l8 7.5"/><path d="M6 10v9h12v-9"/><path d="M10 19v-5h4v5"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Quarantine &amp; Separation</h3>
        <p>New pups sometimes need a separation period from resident pets. [DRAFT &mdash; exact expectations]<span class="draft-flag">Content Needed</span></p>
      </div>
      <div class="action-block gold">
        <div class="icon-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 16V11l2-4.5h12L20 11v5"/><rect x="3.5" y="16" width="17" height="3" rx="1"/><circle cx="7.5" cy="16" r="1.4"/><circle cx="16.5" cy="16" r="1.4"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Transport &amp; Appointments</h3>
        <p>Fosters help get pups to vet visits and adoption meet &amp; greets as needed.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="action-block seafoam">
        <div class="icon-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h16v3a4 4 0 01-4 4H8a4 4 0 01-4-4z"/><path d="M4 12V6a2 2 0 012-2h1"/><path d="M9 5.5V4M2.5 19h19"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Puppies Are Messy</h3>
        <p>Accidents, chewing, and mess happen &mdash; fosters follow our care guidance and roll with it.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container split reverse">
    <div class="media" style="order:2;">
      <img src="https://missionbaypuppyrescue.org/cdn/shop/files/happy-black-dog-wide-toothy-grin_1024x1024.webp?v=1738512478" alt="A happy foster dog">
    </div>
    <div style="order:1;">
      <span class="eyebrow">What We Provide</span>
      <h2>You Bring The Love, We Bring The Rest</h2>
      <ul class="paw-list">
        <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 15.5c-2.6 0-5.4 2-5.4 4.6 0 1.3 1 2.2 2.3 2.2.9 0 1.6-.4 2.4-.7.5-.2 1-.4 1.4-.4s.9.2 1.4.4c.8.3 1.5.7 2.4.7 1.3 0 2.3-.9 2.3-2.2 0-2.6-2.6-4.6-5.2-4.6z"/><ellipse cx="5.5" cy="10.8" rx="1.8" ry="2.4"/><ellipse cx="9.5" cy="7.2" rx="1.9" ry="2.6"/><ellipse cx="14.5" cy="7.2" rx="1.9" ry="2.6"/><ellipse cx="18.5" cy="10.8" rx="1.8" ry="2.4"/></svg> <span>Food</span></li>
        <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 15.5c-2.6 0-5.4 2-5.4 4.6 0 1.3 1 2.2 2.3 2.2.9 0 1.6-.4 2.4-.7.5-.2 1-.4 1.4-.4s.9.2 1.4.4c.8.3 1.5.7 2.4.7 1.3 0 2.3-.9 2.3-2.2 0-2.6-2.6-4.6-5.2-4.6z"/><ellipse cx="5.5" cy="10.8" rx="1.8" ry="2.4"/><ellipse cx="9.5" cy="7.2" rx="1.9" ry="2.6"/><ellipse cx="14.5" cy="7.2" rx="1.9" ry="2.6"/><ellipse cx="18.5" cy="10.8" rx="1.8" ry="2.4"/></svg> <span>Pens &amp; crates</span></li>
        <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 15.5c-2.6 0-5.4 2-5.4 4.6 0 1.3 1 2.2 2.3 2.2.9 0 1.6-.4 2.4-.7.5-.2 1-.4 1.4-.4s.9.2 1.4.4c.8.3 1.5.7 2.4.7 1.3 0 2.3-.9 2.3-2.2 0-2.6-2.6-4.6-5.2-4.6z"/><ellipse cx="5.5" cy="10.8" rx="1.8" ry="2.4"/><ellipse cx="9.5" cy="7.2" rx="1.9" ry="2.6"/><ellipse cx="14.5" cy="7.2" rx="1.9" ry="2.6"/><ellipse cx="18.5" cy="10.8" rx="1.8" ry="2.4"/></svg> <span>Medications</span></li>
        <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 15.5c-2.6 0-5.4 2-5.4 4.6 0 1.3 1 2.2 2.3 2.2.9 0 1.6-.4 2.4-.7.5-.2 1-.4 1.4-.4s.9.2 1.4.4c.8.3 1.5.7 2.4.7 1.3 0 2.3-.9 2.3-2.2 0-2.6-2.6-4.6-5.2-4.6z"/><ellipse cx="5.5" cy="10.8" rx="1.8" ry="2.4"/><ellipse cx="9.5" cy="7.2" rx="1.9" ry="2.6"/><ellipse cx="14.5" cy="7.2" rx="1.9" ry="2.6"/><ellipse cx="18.5" cy="10.8" rx="1.8" ry="2.4"/></svg> <span>Pee pads &amp; basic supplies</span></li>
      </ul>
      <p style="opacity:.7; font-size:.9rem; margin-top:16px;">[DRAFT &mdash; full supply list pending Jackie&rsquo;s confirmation]<span class="draft-flag">Content Needed</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section sand-deep" id="foster-application">
  <div class="container" style="text-align:center;">
    <span class="eyebrow" style="justify-content:center;">Current Status</span>
    <h2>Foster Applications</h2>
    <div style="max-width:640px; margin:0 auto; background:var(--white); border:1px solid var(--sand-line); border-radius:var(--radius-lg); box-shadow:var(--shadow-md); padding:42px 30px;">
      <div style="width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:16px;background:var(--gold-pale);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 16px;color:var(--gold-deep);"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="6" y="4.5" width="12" height="16" rx="1.5"/><rect x="9" y="3" width="6" height="3" rx="1"/><path d="M9 11h6M9 14.5h6M9 17.5h3.5"/></svg></div>
      <h3 style="margin-bottom:10px;">Temporarily Closed</h3>
      <p style="opacity:.78; margin-bottom:20px;">We&rsquo;re updating our foster application process and will reopen soon. Check back shortly, or explore other ways to help right now.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-navy" href="/donate">Other Ways to Support MBPR</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section tight">
  <div class="container" style="text-align:center;">
    <a class="link-quiet" href="/faq#fostering">Read the Foster FAQ &rarr;</a>
  </div>
</section>
</MBPRLayout>